Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: fgss
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, openssh-client
Description: push and run scripts on remote hosts over ssh/scp
 fgss copies a script to a remote host with scp and executes it over ssh,
 honouring ~/.ssh/config. Bundled scripts live in /etc/fgss/scripts.
